    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications:3141.PLN.BSP.100, 3141.PLN.BSP.101, 3141.PLN.BSP.102, 3141.PLN.BSP.103, 3141.PLN.BSP.104, 3141.PLN.BSP.105, 3141.PLN.BSP.106, 3141.PLN.BSP.107, Planning Statement, Report in Respect of Market Demand,  Fire Compliance Statement received 5 January 2023.",
    "Condition : 3 - Notwithstanding the details shown on the approved plans, prior to the commencement of the hereby approved development, a Travel Plan must be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The Travel Plan should show the proposed parking layout including blue badge and EV spaces, access arrangements, pedestrian routes and detail the amount of traffic generation anticipated by the change of use.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the submitted details and prior to occupation, full details (including manufacturer's specifications) of all cycle stands (long and short-term) for users of and visitors to, the development shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\nThe approved facilities shall be fully implemented and made available for use before any part of the development is first occupied and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction.\r\n"
